# Vercel deploys only the Next.js web app from this repo.
# api/ is the Fastify backend (deployed separately from its own Docker
# context); left in, Vercel compiles every .ts file under a root api/ folder
# into a Serverless Function and the deploy exceeds the plan's function limit.
# mobile/ is the Expo app and is not part of the web build.
/api
/mobile
